配色思路参考了 dsh-dream-skin（MIT）：用 OKLCH 明度阶梯生成表面色，再用 WCAG / APCA
对比度求解调整文字色。棱镜的代码全部重写，没有复制 dsh-dream-skin 的源代码。

The palette approach draws on dsh-dream-skin (MIT): surfaces generated from an
OKLCH lightness ladder, and text colors adjusted by a WCAG / APCA contrast
solver. Prism's code is a complete rewrite; no dsh-dream-skin source code was
copied.

