代码配色方案的颜色值取自各方案公开的色板（GitHub、One、Solarized、Dracula、Monokai、
Nord），只用作起始颜色，生成时会按对比度调整明度。

The code color schemes start from the publicly documented palettes of GitHub,
One, Solarized, Dracula, Monokai and Nord; lightness is adjusted for contrast
when the palette is generated.
